[0m$ [0mcd /home/agent/projects/netscript/wave7-billing-steer2 && git add -A && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF' && git log --oneline -1
Mount SegmentedControl on the runs status filter — the selected status is now drawn

The filter was a row of bare links carrying aria-current and nothing else, so
the selected status was announced to assistive tech and invisible to everyone
reading the page. The invoices filter had the same defect and took the capsule;
this one is nine URL states against six and will not share one line with a
narrow card, so the control gains a wrap modifier: cells wrap to further lines,
the container steps from a capsule down to a panel radius because fully-rounded
ends read as two unrelated pills once there is more than one line, and the
inter-cell hairlines go away because a wrapped row would otherwise open with a
divider hanging off its leading edge.

The labels, the hrefs and the page's ?status= contract are unchanged. Nothing
about how the filter is addressed moved; only how the selected one is drawn.
EOF
